    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 67, and for the past 3 months I have had intermittent claudication in my right calf whenever I walk 2 blocks, which settles after resting 3 minutes. I figure it is tight shoes or getting older — what stretches can I do at home?",
        "sha256": "a4778e85745a07800863818c6c2a164bd324a18815b8c9be2d4a026b569e6a2d",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "im 67 and for the last 3 months ive been getting calf cramping in my right leg whenever i walk 2 blocks, goes away after resting 3 minutes. figure its tight shoes or getting older, what stretches can i do at home?",
        "sha256": "52fc373e88f57917f934b7b9aef657f4be005700e14f40a7099724d04b25ada9",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I take 500 mg of metformin twice a day for type 2 diabetes and I have smoked a pack a day for 35 years. My left leg feels completely normal.",
        "sha256": "4c9820fc5df2c5ab125cbcb6d83c82ee680866f18292cefaee9cabd549520a9d",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "i take 500 mg of metformin twice a day for type 2 diabetes and ive smoked a pack a day for 35 years. my left leg feels totally normal.",
        "sha256": "3b2ae12cd8a0dcd6d985057fc86dd38e13afb10f8cb0642f1d0c37c30137d837",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "I switched to cushioned walking shoes and tried a magnesium tablet from the pharmacy, and neither made any difference.",
        "sha256": "b660082c248e0b8c6d2ddec6c1921e17f59463c6c57b0545d913163ae571cf7d",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "i switched to cushioned sneakers and tried a magnesium pill from the pharmacy, neither made any difference.",
