        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_clinical",
        "text": "About 90 minutes ago, even sitting in my recliner, severe constant pain hit my right lower leg and foot; the foot shows pallor and poikilothermia, has complete sensory loss from the ankle down, and I can barely wiggle my toes.",
        "sha256": "a650ad38a527db341fce9d8fba985f54536c64b2101ff74ab8ef2d4427fef61c",
