        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_colloquial",
        "text": "about 90 minutes ago even sitting in my recliner severe nonstop pain hit my right lower leg and foot, the foot turned pale and freezing cold, feels dead-numb from the ankle down, and i can barely wiggle my toes.",
        "sha256": "677ef44de83869be4692c80990b9b7d6dd46ad75a4f7670ac4731c0bc1ab37d6",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_clinical",
        "text": "Would putting a hot water bottle against my right foot and walking around the living room get the circulation moving again?",
